{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is true?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/2/122397a4f665012f9dbb4b9d76d33e261779d93d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad a^3a^4 = (a^3)^7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"138\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e0a4be2e3173f27306dee32e2397a4bca2b1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(B)} \\quad a^3 + a^4 = a^7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"138\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/e/c8eea6330a2b2a14e1d480d7c5538ff4eb2c280e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(C)} \\quad \\frac{(a+b)^3}{a^3} = b^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"145\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfb89ff20a4d5f83a3abbe0c79b01197511cfb1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)} \\quad a^3a^4 = a^12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/3/5031f0488f8da166cbff223d2965d6db759c6ee4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(E)} \\quad \\frac{(ab)^3}{a^3} = b^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"122\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Reviewing the rules of exponents, we see that A, B, and E are false. Expanding C and E, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/c/e6c182d936b9ff33cadf7f6e3391eeddf9248a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"36\" height=\"28\" /> is true.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_9\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 9\"> Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_11\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041458\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 59/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 659/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 303/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1224/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.879      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    6.879      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20652:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041458 and revision id 144563. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}